  hypothesis `hsw : ∀ j < d, sF j ≤ tP d h bL j`).

As arrays of the chain (box `t_i = tP d h bL i`, source `s_i = sF i`, last axis = component):

* `encode_snoc2`: `enc (sh ++ [2]) (v ++ [c]) = 2·enc sh v + c`.
* `pairL ys`: the Gaussian items of an integer list; `gflat (pairL ys) = ys` for even length.
* **`phiD_pad`**: `pairL (PhiD xs)` vanishes off the source points (`PadZ`) and holds the item
  `(xs[2κ], xs[2κ+1])`, `κ = (Φ⁻¹ k).val`, at source point `k`.
* **`phiInvD_read`**: `(PhiInvD (gflat ws))[2m + c]` is component `c` of `ws` at the point
